            <ArticleTitle>[Tenosynovial giant cell tumor in the differential diagnosis of painful heel].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1175-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Based on a case report regarding a patient with a tenosynovial tumor in the calcaneal spur area, we present a compilation of the differential diagnoses in the event of heel pain. The diagnostic procedure is dealt with peripherally. As to the various therapeutic possibilities, we refer to the literature.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
